quran[32]{c,v,t}:
  86,1,By the sky and by the Night-Comer!
  86,2,And what will make you realise what the Night-Comer is?
  86,3,(It is) the star of intense brightness.
  86,4,There is no soul without a (vigilant) guard over it.
  86,5,So let human being consider from what (substance) he has been created.
  86,6,"He has been created from a gushing fluid,"
  86,7,that stems from between the loins and the pelvic bones.
  86,8,"Indeed, He is Capable of returning him (to life again),"
  86,9,"on the Day when the secrets are disclosed,"
  86,10,and one will have neither (any) power nor helper.
  86,11,"By the heavens returning to their primitive state,"
  86,12,and by the earth splitting asunder (into dust particles):
  86,13,"It is indeed a decisive Word,"
  86,14,and it is not a joke!
  86,15,"Indeed, they are devising an evil scheme."
  86,16,And I (too) am designing a strategy.
  86,17,So give the disbelievers respite; let them relax a little (more).
  87,1,"Glorify the Name of your Lord, the Most Exalted,"
  87,2,"Who created and fashioned (all in perfect proportion),"
  87,3,"Who designed (everything) with precisely programmed measure and guided (accordingly),"
  87,4,"and brought out the green pasture (from the earth),"
  87,5,then turned it into blackish withered husks.
  87,6,"We shall make you recite (the Qur’an) so that you do not forget (any of it),"
  87,7,"except what Allah wills. Indeed, He knows what is open and what is hidden."
  87,8,We will facilitate you to (the way of) ease.
  87,9,"So keep reminding (with this Qur’an), even if the reminder is beneficial (only to some)."
  87,10,"The fearful will (accept it and) become mindful,"
  87,11,while the most unfortunate will avoid it.
  87,12,"He (is the one) who will enter the Greatest Fire,"
  87,13,where he will neither die nor live.
  87,14,"He is successful indeed, who purifies himself,"
  87,15,and (who) remembers the Name of his Lord and prays (regularly).
